  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f209910\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/902/screen_a5.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moon-and-space-dimensions-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Space Dimensions</a> 模組的 Fabric 移植版。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>可前往的世界</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/456/333/spacedimensions_planetset.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>載具</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/456/351/spacedimensions_vehicleset.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>利用村民的工作站來推進模組進度（規劃師、機械師、回收員和研究員工作站）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/472/374/researcher_screen.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>計劃中的改進包括與 JEI 的兼容性以及與其他科技模組的良好協作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
